{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>GET A TASTE OF SUPER DEBT WITH THIS EARLY DEVELOPMENT DEMO, FEATURING:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">60+ RANDOMIZED ROOMS!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">2 BOSSES!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">5 MINIGAMES</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">4 WEAPONS!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">30+ MODULES (Upgrades/Items)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">MODULE BUILDER MODE</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">TWO-PLAYER CO-OP</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">ZOE ZOMBIE, the main character you play as!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">AN ending!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398240/extras/Gun_320.png?t=1744404911\" /> </p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>TIME IS MONEY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every moment that passes eats away at your bank account! Once you're out of money you die in one hit!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>RUN AND SURVIVE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Race through carefully crafted rooms chock full of enemies and bullets that will test your execution and reflexes!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>UNLOCK WEAPONS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Find and unlock a variety of different weapons with vastly different mechanics and playstyles!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>PLAY WITH A FRIEND</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play through the whole game with a friend! Switch from One to Two Player anywhere at a moment's notice!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>COLLECT AND SELL</strong>\u00a0<strong>MODULES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Find modules that will strengthen your abilities in order to survive! Modules can be sold in a pinch if you're lookin' for some extra cash!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>WITNESS A MOODY AND DIMLY LIT ATMOSPHERE</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Lovingly crafted pixel art, music, and art direction come together to create a unique experience!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>MADE BY ONE PERSON</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Wow! Are they okay?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>...</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Just don't get hit and everything will probably be okay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398240/extras/Lean_320.png?t=1744404911\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong><i>Content Description:</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>This game contains horror elements, mild blood and gore, and mild\u00a0language.</i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3398240?t=1744404911","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3398240?t=1744404911","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398240/92af45bb9f32b13c1024f6b591495c8a5c81da11/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744404911","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398240/92af45bb9f32b13c1024f6b591495c8a5c81da11/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744404911","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>GET A TASTE OF SUPER DEBT WITH THIS EARLY DEVELOPMENT DEMO, FEATURING:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">60+ RANDOMIZED ROOMS!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">2 BOSSES!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">5 MINIGAMES</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">4